{"id":"n36752-1-11","stage":5,"title":"구토 · 呕吐","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36752-1-11-1","ko":"식중독에 걸렸다면서? 몸은 좀 어때?","zh":"听说你得了食物中毒？身体怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식중독에","meaning":"食物中毒","explanation":"식중독：食物中毒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"식중독","audio":"/audio/62a61b668ec8f54a03d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90754","senseId":"1","lemma":"식중독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식중독에","audio":"/audio/6143ad78f822acb93422.mp3"}},{"text":"걸렸다면서?","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸렸다면서","audio":"/audio/fe13e6fe3a48638c562e.mp3"}},{"text":"몸은","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸은","audio":"/audio/21eb3e3763116cb3d09f.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"62a61b668ec8f54a","term":"식중독","zh":"食物中毒","audio":"/audio/62a61b668ec8f54a03d0.mp3","entryId":"90754","definition":"吃了食物中的有毒物质而得的病。","pronunciation":["식쭝독"